50,3,1,talk,Minato,,"The candidates are A: Workflow Assistant, B: Training Studio, C: Supplier Data Hub, and D: Field Service App. I lean toward C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,D is impossible given the network coverage and approval delays I found. I cannot support it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,B might be too expensive if it requires capital for a studio. C fits the software allowance better.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,May,,"A requires daily entry from many people, which my research shows usually leads to failure. I prefer C.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Midori,,C solves the misrouted deliveries and the time lost to copying records. It's the most practical.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, would C be too much extra work for the coordination group?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, if C is a central repository, it avoids the network issues of D entirely.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, as long as it's a software-based hub, it should fit our current budget constraints.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, C is about standardization, and while some efforts fail, a central catalog is a lasting resource.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. It addresses the root cause of the errors I saw in the logs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Minato,,I feel more comfortable with C now. It seems helpful.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. It is the safest and most logical choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,George,,I am satisfied with C. It is fiscally responsible.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,May,,It's the only one that aligns with the survival patterns of previous projects.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm voting for C!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Minato,,I vote for C.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
